'''Riba''' was a female [[tauntaun]] and daughter of [[Murra (tauntaun)|Murra]]. She was one of several tauntauns utilized by the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] on the [[planet]] [[Hoth]].<ref name="FACPOV" /> She was [[Reproduction|pregnant]] with taunlets when she was killed and eaten by a [[wampa]].<ref name="FACPOV">{{StoryCite|story=She Will Keep Them Warm|book=From a Certain Point of View: The Empire Strikes Back}}</ref>

